# Tooling
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
# data/distill/ is NOT ignored: unlike other data/ subdirs (downloadable or
# locally regenerable in minutes), the teacher-labeled JSONL here represents
# ~14 GPU-hours through a fragile multi-account Kaggle pipeline and is small
# (a few MB, text only, no images) -- exactly the "small, expensive, not
# cheaply regenerable" profile that belongs in version control, like
# results/results.csv.
